      "hintHtml": "<span class=\"vp-hint-row\"><b class=\"vp-brief-form\">Same verb</b><span>Repeat the helper from the question: Do → do, Is → is, Can → can.</span></span><span class=\"vp-hint-row\"><b class=\"vp-brief-form\">Yes</b><span>Yes, I do. Yes, she is.</span></span><span class=\"vp-hint-row\"><b class=\"vp-brief-form\">No</b><span>Add n't: No, I don't. No, she isn't.</span></span>",
